      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i checked the soil and it actually feels really damp, like it's staying wet for way longer than it should even when i wait a week. i'm kinda worried there might be something more than just water issues tho. it feels like there's something hidden in the pot making it rot, like some tiny little thing living in there that's just working away at the roots in the dark. do you think it could be some kind of pest or something like that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
